{"id":"controls-and-keys","title":"Controls and keys","category":"getting-started","icon":"minecraft:comparator","summary":"Every key, mouse action and chat command a player uses in SkyRPG.","blocks":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"SkyRPG adds a handful of keys on top of vanilla Minecraft, a lot of mouse actions inside its screens, and a set of chat commands. This page lists all of them in one place. Keys can be changed in Minecraft's Controls screen, under the "},{"x":"SkyRPG","b":true},{"x":" category. In the game's own messages the key is shown as whatever you bound it to; this page names the defaults."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Keys","anchor":"keys"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Default key"}],[{"x":"Action"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"K","b":true}],[{"x":"Open SkyBlock Menu"}],[{"x":"The menu opens on the SkyBlock Menu, with your Skills, Collections, Storage, Fast Travel and more. Press again to close. See "},{"x":"SkyBlock Menu","link":"skyblock-menu"},{"x":" and "},{"x":"K menu","link":"k-menu"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"M","b":true}],[{"x":"Open World Map"}],[{"x":"Everything you have explored in this dimension. Press again to close. See "},{"x":"HUD and minimap","link":"hud-and-minimap"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"=","b":true}],[{"x":"Minimap Zoom In"}],[{"x":"Zooms the minimap in, up to 4 pixels per block."}]],[[{"x":"-","b":true}],[{"x":"Minimap Zoom Out"}],[{"x":"Zooms the minimap out, down to a quarter pixel per block."}]],[[{"x":"B","b":true}],[{"x":"Open Backpack"}],[{"x":"Opens the backpack in your first backpack slot. See "},{"x":"Backpacks","link":"backpacks"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"J","b":true}],[{"x":"Brainrot album"}],[{"x":"Opens your brainrot album. See "},{"x":"Brainrots","link":"brainrots"},{"x":"."}]],[[{"x":"H","b":true}],[{"x":"Look up in Wiki"}],[{"x":"Hover an item in any inventory and press this to open its wiki entry."}]],[[{"x":"Tab","b":true},{"x":" (hold)"}],[{"x":"Player list"}],[{"x":"Shows the SkyRPG player list with heads, ping and info panels. Can be switched off in "},{"x":"Settings","link":"settings"},{"x":"."}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Vanilla keys keep their normal job."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Keys from the pack's extra mods","anchor":"keys-from-the-pack-s-extra-mods"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"These come from the performance and comfort mods the pack installs (see "},{"x":"Mods and shaders","link":"mods-and-shaders"},{"x":"). They sit in the Controls screen under their own mod names."}]},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Default key"}],[{"x":"Mod"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"C","b":true},{"x":" (hold)"}],[{"x":"Zoomify"}],[{"x":"Zoom in like a spyglass. Scroll while holding it to zoom more or less. Vanilla's \"save hotbar\" key (also C) is unbound once on first launch so the two don't clash."}]],[[{"x":"F6","b":true},{"x":" (hold)"}],[{"x":"Zoomify"}],[{"x":"A stronger zoom that also hides the HUD."}]],[[{"x":"I","b":true}],[{"x":"Iris"}],[{"x":"Open the shader pack list."}]],[[{"x":"U","b":true}],[{"x":"Iris"}],[{"x":"Switch shaders on or off. SkyRPG moves this off "},{"x":"K","b":true},{"x":" the first time you play, so it does not clash with the menu."}]],[[{"x":"R","b":true}],[{"x":"Iris"}],[{"x":"Reload the shader pack."}]],[[{"x":"Not set"}],[{"x":"Mod Menu"}],[{"x":"Open the mod list. Bind a key in Controls if you want one."}]]],"align":["l","l","l"]},{"t":"h2","text":"Inside the SkyBlock Menu","anchor":"inside-the-skyblock-menu"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Click a tile"}],[{"x":"Open that page"}]],[[{"x":"Up and Down arrows"}],[{"x":"Move to the previous or next page"}]],[[{"x":"1","b":true},{"x":" to "},{"x":"9","b":true}],[{"x":"Jump to the first nine pages in the sidebar"}]],[[{"x":"K","b":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"Esc","b":true}],[{"x":"Close the menu. Esc first steps back inside a page, for example clearing a search."}]],[[{"x":"Scroll wheel"}],[{"x":"Scrolls the page"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Pages with a text field (the Settings search, the Bazaar and Auction House searches, the Bank) take digits and letters first, so numbers type instead of switching pages."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"In shops","anchor":"in-shops"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Click an offer"}],[{"x":"Buy one"}]],[[{"x":"Shift-click an offer"}],[{"x":"Buy a stack"}]],[[{"x":"Click an item in the sell panel"}],[{"x":"Sell the whole stack"}]],[[{"x":"Click a sold item in the buyback row"}],[{"x":"Take back one of your last nine sales for the same coins"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"NPC Shops","link":"npc-shops"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"At the Bank","anchor":"at-the-bank"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Type an amount, "},{"x":"Enter","b":true}],[{"x":"Deposit"}]],[[{"x":"Shift+Enter","b":true}],[{"x":"Withdraw"}]],[[{"x":"All","b":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Half","b":true},{"x":" buttons"}],[{"x":"Move all or half of the coins"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Amounts accept "},{"x":"k","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"m","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"b","c":true},{"x":", so "},{"x":"2.5k","c":true},{"x":" is 2,500 and "},{"x":"1m","c":true},{"x":" is 1,000,000. See "},{"x":"Coins and the bank","link":"coins-and-bank"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"On the world map and HUD editor","anchor":"on-the-world-map-and-hud-editor"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Input"}],[{"x":"Action"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"Drag"}],[{"x":"Move the map"}]],[[{"x":"Scroll"}],[{"x":"Zoom towards the mouse"}]],[[{"x":"C","b":true}],[{"x":"Follow yourself"}]],[[{"x":"Right-click the map"}],[{"x":"Drop a waypoint"}]],[[{"x":"Click or right-click an icon"}],[{"x":"Track, share or remove it"}]],[[{"x":"Drag a box (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Move it"}]],[[{"x":"Scroll over a box (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Resize it, 0.5x to 2x"}]],[[{"x":"Right-click a box (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Hide or show it"}]],[[{"x":"R","b":true},{"x":" (HUD editor)"}],[{"x":"Reset the box under the mouse, or every box if the mouse is on none"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"Waypoints","link":"waypoints"},{"x":" and "},{"x":"HUD and minimap","link":"hud-and-minimap"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h2","text":"In the world","anchor":"in-the-world"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"Right-click an NPC","b":true},{"x":" to shop, bank, reforge, enchant, start slayer quests or ride a lift. See "},{"x":"NPCs","link":"npcs"},{"x":"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a minion","b":true},{"x":" to open its screen. "},{"x":"Right-click the top of a block","b":true},{"x":" on your own island with a minion in your hand to place it. See "},{"x":"Minions","link":"minions"},{"x":"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a crafting table","b":true},{"x":", or type "},{"x":"/craft","c":true},{"x":", to open the 3 by 3 crafting grid. "},{"x":"Right-click an ender chest","b":true},{"x":" to open your Ender Chest pages. See "},{"x":"Recipe Book","link":"recipe-book"},{"x":" and "},{"x":"Storage and Wardrobe","link":"storage-and-wardrobe"},{"x":"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a weapon or tool","b":true},{"x":" to use its ability, if it has one."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click an accessory","b":true},{"x":" to put it on. "},{"x":"Right-click a backpack","b":true},{"x":" in its slot to open it. Backpack and accessory slots sit in strips beside your inventory and hide while the recipe book is open."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Right-click a pet item","b":true},{"x":" to move it into your pet storage and equip it."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Step on a launch pad","b":true},{"x":" to be thrown to the island it points at. See "},{"x":"The Islands","link":"the-islands"},{"x":"."}]},{"s":[{"x":"Click a Fairy Soul","b":true},{"x":" to collect it. See "},{"x":"The Hub","link":"the-hub#fairy-souls"},{"x":"."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"Chat commands","anchor":"chat-commands"},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Commands start with "},{"x":"/","c":true},{"x":" and are typed in chat. Anyone can use these."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Travel","anchor":"travel"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/is","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/island","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/warp home","c":true}],[{"x":"Go to your Private Island"}]],[[{"x":"/hub","c":true}],[{"x":"Go to the Hub"}]],[[{"x":"/warp <place>","c":true}],[{"x":"Go to an island or area you have visited: "},{"x":"hub","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"home","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"crypt","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"castle","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"da","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"barn","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"desert","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"park","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"gold","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"deep","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"spider","c":true}]],[[{"x":"/visit <player>","c":true}],[{"x":"Visit the island of the profile a player is playing. You can look, not touch"}]],[[{"x":"/waypoint ...","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/wp ...","c":true}],[{"x":"Make and use waypoints. See "},{"x":"Waypoints","link":"waypoints"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Every warp has a short warm-up: stand still. You can't warp in combat, and running the command again cancels it. See "},{"x":"SkyBlock Menu","link":"skyblock-menu#fast-travel"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Profiles","anchor":"profiles"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/profiles","c":true}],[{"x":"List your profiles, with buttons to switch or create one"}]],[[{"x":"/profiles switch <name>","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"/profiles create","c":true}],[{"x":"Switch to a profile, or start a new one"}]],[[{"x":"/coopadd <player>","c":true}],[{"x":"Invite a player to your co-op"}]],[[{"x":"/coop accept <player>","c":true}],[{"x":"Accept a co-op invite"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"Profiles and islands","link":"profiles-and-islands"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"h3","text":"Menus","anchor":"menus"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/craft","c":true}],[{"x":"Open the crafting grid"}]],[[{"x":"/storage","c":true}],[{"x":"Open Storage"}]],[[{"x":"/ec [page]","c":true}],[{"x":"Open an Ender Chest page"}]],[[{"x":"/wardrobe","c":true}],[{"x":"Open the Wardrobe"}]],[[{"x":"/bz","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/bazaar","c":true}],[{"x":"Open the Bazaar (SkyBlock Level 7)"}]],[[{"x":"/ah","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/auctionhouse","c":true}],[{"x":"Open the Auction House"}]],[[{"x":"/sblevel","c":true}],[{"x":"Open SkyBlock Leveling"}]],[[{"x":"/wiki [page]","c":true}],[{"x":"Open the in-game wiki"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h3","text":"Money and info","anchor":"money-and-info"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/coins [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your purse and bank, or another player's"}]],[[{"x":"/sell","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/sell hand","c":true}],[{"x":"Sell the stack in your hand"}]],[[{"x":"/sell all","c":true}],[{"x":"Sell every stack of the item in your hand"}]],[[{"x":"/sell inventory","c":true}],[{"x":"Sell everything NPCs will buy"}]],[[{"x":"/worth","c":true}],[{"x":"Show what the item in your hand sells for"}]],[[{"x":"/skills [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show skills"}]],[[{"x":"/stats [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show stats"}]],[[{"x":"/pet","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/pet away","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/pet storage","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your pet, put it away, list your pet storage"}]],[[{"x":"@skyhelper <question>","c":true},{"x":" in chat, or "},{"x":"/ask <question>","c":true}],[{"x":"Ask SkyHelper, the assistant. "},{"x":"/ask","c":true},{"x":" answers only you. See "},{"x":"SkyHelper","link":"skyhelper"}]],[[{"x":"/party ...","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/p ...","c":true}],[{"x":"Make and manage a party. See "},{"x":"Party","link":"party"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"h3","text":"Chat","anchor":"chat"},{"t":"table","head":[[{"x":"Command"}],[{"x":"What it does"}]],"rows":[[[{"x":"/msg","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/tell","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/w <player> <text>","c":true}],[{"x":"Whisper"}]],[[{"x":"/r <text>","c":true},{"x":" or "},{"x":"/reply <text>","c":true}],[{"x":"Reply to the last person who whispered you"}]],[[{"x":"/me <text>","c":true}],[{"x":"Describe an action"}]],[[{"x":"/pc <message>","c":true}],[{"x":"Send a message to your party"}]],[[{"x":"/party chat","c":true}],[{"x":"Switch your chat to party chat, and back"}]],[[{"x":"/emotes","c":true}],[{"x":"List the emotes. Click one to use it"}]],[[{"x":"/stickers","c":true}],[{"x":"List the stickers. Click one to put it in your message"}]],[[{"x":"/share screenshot [file]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your newest screenshot, or a named one, to everyone"}]],[[{"x":"/chat level [player]","c":true}],[{"x":"Show your SkyRPG chat level, or another player's"}]]],"align":["l","l"]},{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"See "},{"x":"Chat","link":"chat"},{"x":"."}]},{"t":"callout","kind":"note","b":[{"t":"p","s":[{"x":"Operators have more commands, such as "},{"x":"/sbitem","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/sbshop","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/fairysouls","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/storage unlock","c":true},{"x":", "},{"x":"/coins give","c":true},{"x":" and "},{"x":"/hubadmin","c":true},{"x":". They are not covered here."}]}]},{"t":"h2","text":"See also","anchor":"see-also"},{"t":"ul","items":[{"s":[{"x":"SkyBlock Menu","link":"skyblock-menu"}]},{"s":[{"x":"K menu","link":"k-menu"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Settings","link":"settings"}]},{"s":[{"x":"Chat","link":"chat"}]},{"s":[{"x":"HUD and minimap","link":"hud-and-minimap"}]}]}]}